    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels more like a losing battle. every day it's a little more lost. i want to hold onto my dignity while i still can. i don't want to be a shadow of a person, just waiting for the lights to go out. there's something to be said for leaving before everything is gone, don't you think? like, wouldn't it be more peaceful to end it while the 'me' is still actually here?",
